        <div class="card-body">
            <p class="mb-4"><strong>Trace tables</strong> are manual checks of logic. <strong>Breakpoints</strong> allow you to pause execution in an IDE.</p>

            <div class="grid-2">
                <div>
                    <h3>Algorithm: Linear Search</h3>
                    <pre><code class="python">nums = [10, 50, 30]
target = 50
found = False
for i in range(len(nums)):
    if nums[i] == target:
        found = True
        break</code></pre>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3>Trace Table</h3>
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table>
